/E (When we were assigned a project to serve our peers, the first thing that went through our minds was to solve the parking crisis. Many students were complaining in the EUE WhatsApp group about other cars blocking their way out of their parking spaces, and when they tried to reach out to the person blocking them, they only had to go through the EUE WhatsApp main channel, take a picture of the car that was blocking them, and post it, but it rarely works since most students mute the WhatsApp group due to the high traffic on it. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
